00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:44.270
And then we individually
create random encryption keys

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:45.590
for each single one.

00:02:45.590 --> 00:02:47.810
And those encryption keys
get regenerated every time

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:49.700
you update that data.

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:51.534
And they get sprayed
out to the data center.

00:02:51.534 --> 00:02:53.949
So if you attended the talk
that Maya and I did yesterday,

00:02:53.949 --> 00:02:55.760
we talked a little
bit more about this,

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:57.860
