00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:01.010
But you know, the keys
that actually protect

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:03.380
each of those chunks is
protected through a key that's

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:05.051
in our internal
KMS system that's

00:03:05.051 --> 00:03:06.800
protected through
elaborate keying system.

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:09.770
