do, we can't help you

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.636
because those things
are going to fail.

00:04:57.636 --> 00:04:59.010
We don't have the
key to do that.

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:01.910
So as a result, it's only
available for GCE and GCS.

00:05:01.910 --> 00:05:04.130
And we'll likely
not go beyond that.

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:06.680
And then finally, on the
far right side-- and this

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:10.460
