in your own device

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:19.970
that you want to have complete
control over and insurance

00:05:19.970 --> 00:05:21.050
and everything else.

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:23.690
And so you will provide the HSM.

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:26.630
And we'll help you
host it somewhere close

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:28.820
to one of our data centers.

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:31.130
And we can help set up the
high-speed interconnect,

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:34.070
provide a super low
latency connection to this.

00:05:34.070 --> 00:05:35.900
Obviously, the
downside to this is

00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:40.010
